{"id":"n15658-1-9","stage":3,"title":"사냥 · 打猎","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15658-1-9-1","ko":"요즘 이 동네에 멧돼지가 내려온다면서?","zh":"听说最近这附近有野猪出没？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"동네에","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네에","audio":"/audio/a769ae43f633cb32c310.mp3"}},{"text":"멧돼지가","meaning":"野猪","explanation":"멧돼지：野猪；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"멧돼지","audio":"/audio/84031a103eb87b00d280.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55538","senseId":"1","lemma":"멧돼지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멧돼지가","audio":"/audio/bf35189755f15e029467.mp3"}},{"text":"내려온다면서?","meaning":"下，回","explanation":"내려오다：下，回；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"내려오다","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64559","senseId":"2","lemma":"내려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려온다면서","audio":"/audio/058baae6d3f3caa2c69f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49"